              "id": "CVE-2026-9496",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "pacote: Pacote: Denial of Service via crafted spec.rawSpec value in addGitSha function"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Versions of the package pacote from 11.2.7 and before 21.5.1 are vulnerable to Denial of Service (DoS) via the addGitSha function. An attacker can exploit this vulnerability by supplying a specially crafted spec.rawSpec value that triggers the function’s regex replacement and string-manipulation logic,  causing excessive CPU consumption and potentially stalling or crashing the process."
              },
